'.\" -*- nroff -*-
.TH KAFS-V7 8 "2026-07-07" "kafs 0.4.0" "System Administration"
.SH NAME
kafs-v7 \- dedicated format v7 runtime entrypoint
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B kafs-v7
.RB --image
.I image
.B --inspection-mount
.I mountpoint
.BR -o " " ro
.RI [ FUSE\ options ]
.PP
.B kafs-v7
.RB --image
.I image
.B --controlled-write-mount
.I mountpoint
.BR -o " " rw,no_writeback_cache,no_trim_on_free,bg_dedup_scan=off,fsync_policy=full
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B kafs-v7
is the dedicated format v7 runtime entrypoint.
It validates the format v7 CLI boundary, rejects legacy
.B v6_*
mount-option mode tokens, runs descriptor preflight, and then admits the
selected descriptor-backed runtime contract.
.PP
Format v6 was an experimental implementation used to split the runtime
entrypoint, descriptor admission, and controlled-write policy away from the
production
.BR kafs (1)
binary.  Format v7 is the breaking-change continuation of that work.  The
current v7 implementation has its own entrypoint/runtime/adapter source set;
only the low-level descriptor scaffold helper still carries historical v6
internal names pending a neutral rename.
.PP
The existing
.B kafs
binary remains the v4/v5 production runtime entrypoint and fails closed for
format v6/v7 images.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR -h ", " --help
Show help and exit.
.TP
.BR --image " " <image>
Specify the format v7 image path.
.TP
.BR --image= "<image>"
Specify the format v7 image path using the inline form.
.TP
.B --inspection-mount
Select the read-only v7 inspection contract.
The request must include
.BR -o " " ro .
.TP
.B --controlled-write-mount
Select the experimental v7 controlled write contract.
The request must include
.BR -o " " rw,no_writeback_cache,no_trim_on_free,bg_dedup_scan=off,fsync_policy=full .
.TP
.BR --option " " <opt[,opt...]>
Alias for FUSE
.BR -o .
.TP
.BR --option= "<opt[,opt...]>"
Inline form of
.BR --option .
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Help was printed.
.TP
.B 2
The request was invalid, the image was not format v7, descriptor preflight
failed, or runtime admission failed.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR kafs (1),
.BR kafs-v6 (8),
.BR mkfs.kafs (8),
.BR fsck.kafs (8),
.BR kafsdump (8)
.SH AUTHOR
kafs project.
